rules.detect:
On added lines: fail r'(?i)(remove|delete|revert)[^
]{0,20}before (landing|merg)|do not (merge|land)'; warn r' (TODO|FIXME|XXX) (?![^
]*(#\d+|bug\s*\d+|bugzilla|[A-Z]{2,5}-\d+|/issues/\d+|/pull/\d+))'. Weekly: rg -o 'TODO[^
]*#(\d+)' then `gh issue view N --json state` / `gh pr view N --json state`; report closed/merged ones as stale.
